{"title":"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> be a positive integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/4843d240c7b2c54b45cfc9ed28b13887dfd36adb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> a prime, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> an integer with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/4/79456269929900c427f42d76b1870e0c28ff0f94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le n\\le p^{k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"101\" height=\"19\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/9/c79b820229a5e0ac8bdd0cab9ce7f744ba6a8756.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\binom{p^k}{pn}\\equiv\\binom{p^{k-1}}n\\pmod{p^{2k+1}}.\\]\" width=\"248\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO\" title=\"2020 CAMO\">2020 CAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All CAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017023608\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 71/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1416/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 48/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 910/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   19.631      1 -total\n 46.90%    9.206      1 Template:CAMO_newbox\n 39.22%    7.699      1 Template:Solution\n 12.40%    2.434      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19651:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017023608 and revision id 133171. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}